"""Human assessments for all detector study use-case bodies."""
import json,pathlib
p=pathlib.Path(__file__).with_name('additional_pfp_application_remaining_notes.json');n=json.loads(p.read_text())
rows={
126:('Full one-line detector-adequacy package docstring read. Names PREREG-DA-001 and AuthorityEffect None.','No implementation or evidence in this marker.'),
127:('Full Stage A battery read. Locks worktree and Git blobs, derives deterministic sampling seed, records detector crashes rather than treating as green, compares independent answer/witness replay, and computes one-sided binomial upper bounds. Certificate checks finite false-green/red/noncertification thresholds, clean crashes, witness replay and n>=300.','Clopper-Pearson formula is evaluated numerically, not exact rational arithmetic; validity is distribution/independence-relative, not universal detector adequacy. certificate trusts summary cells and supplied family coverage; red_uncertified_dual is recorded but unused in issue decision. No test rerun or Git historical commands executed.'),
128:('Full six public held-out mutation families read. Covers drifted posed-system copy, conflicting answers, overriding read claim, decimal approximation, unreduced pivots and vector length mismatch; deep copies preserve source input. Rational determinant/Cramer arithmetic constructs controls.','Authorship independence is a historical assertion, not proved by this file. H1/H5 defects need not always change terminal answer; any-step defect and answer correctness are distinct outcomes. Generation is synthetic finite coverage, not an adversarial completeness theorem.'),
129:('Full exploratory local battery read. Reuses seeded family order and reports local/global detector cross-tab plus witness replay. Explicit exploratory flag correctly prevents promotion after held-out inspection.','No per-detector exception guard in run; an undefined-name/local-runtime error aborts whole study. Same seed pairs items only if family enumeration and RNG draws match frozen baseline. No execution.'),
130:('Full local-only detector read. One-hop citation views omit posed input; D3 retains rref/read/residual/answer, D4 only read. Each retained rational defect is placed on a disjoint triangle before canonical pi call. Noncertification for no usable edges is explicit.','Red branch iterates undefined core at line121 instead of an in-scope mapping; every reached obstruction branch raises NameError. Local consistency cannot detect globally drifted given systems; exploratory status is correctly stated.'),
131:('Full historical Stage B runner read without executing it. Seeded item/prompt locks, fixture-vs-provider distinction, rational price model, in-flight lock and output bytes/digests are implemented. Strict answer judge is separate from lenient trace extraction and structural baselines.','Paid safety claim is not established: retries share one reservation and retain only final response; timeout releases hold at zero; usage int coercion admits negatives/missing zeros and actual can exceed reservation; receipts write only after all jobs finish. Scoring exceptions can abort after paid dispatch. Local detector NameError is not among caught exceptions. Historical price/model constants are not current-price verification; no network or credentials accessed.'),
132:('Full Stage B analysis read. Standardized logistic ridge IRLS, Mann-Whitney tie-aware AUC, item-level first-call bootstrap, secondary out-of-fold estimate, repeated-call oscillation and minimum-event pilot decision.','Primary delta and bootstrap are in-sample refitted AUC; do not establish future predictive gain/causality. Features are standardized using all primary rows before out-of-fold split; no stratification or IRLS convergence receipt. Missing output tokens become zero. No 10000-bootstrap workload rerun.'),
133:('Full seeded linear-system trace generator read. Invertible random 3/4-dimensional integer matrices, exact Fraction Cramer solution, five-step canonical trace, five equivalent controls and four known-defect mutations.','Source controls are synthetic and small; generator resampling loops are not bounded in worst case. Redundant check is copied data despite independent wording. Shared trace values and fixed IDs are representation choices, not independence proof.'),
134:('Full witness replay read. Different arithmetic path uses Cramer and separately loaded dossier mv/check_answer; nonempty witnesses require every named step defective. Outcome judge uses first answer step and original posed system, with all-coordinate check delegated.','Witness coefficients are ignored: this checks defect support, not dual feasibility/value. Duplicate step IDs collapse and missing citation/shape errors may escape; Stage B adds stricter single-answer guard. Independence is implementation diversity with shared generator/runtime, not mathematical or statistical independence.'),
}
for i,(assessment,limits)in rows.items():n[str(i)]={'assessment':assessment,'limits':limits}
p.write_text(json.dumps(n,indent=2)+'\n')
